body.zh:
- 加法原理（分類）：把做法分成幾類，各類分別有 $a_1, a_2, \ldots, a_k$ 種，而每一種做法只屬於其中一類，總數就是 {{math:0}}
- 乘法原理（分步）：要依次完成 $k$ 個步驟，各步分別有 $n_1, n_2, \ldots, n_k$ 種做法，總數就是 {{math:1}}
- 例：餐廳午餐 ＝ 前菜 2 選 1、主菜 4 選 1、飲品 3 選 1。三樣都要揀（分步），所以是 {{math:2}}

body.en:
- Addition principle (cases): split the ways into classes holding $a_1, a_2, \ldots, a_k$ ways, where every way belongs to exactly one class. The total is {{math:0}}
- Multiplication principle (steps): to finish the task you carry out $k$ steps in turn, with $n_1, n_2, \ldots, n_k$ ways at each step. The total is {{math:1}}
- Example: a lunch set = 2 appetizers, 4 main dishes, 3 drinks. All three are chosen (steps), so there are {{math:2}} lunch sets.

body.zh:
- 若 A 與 B 兩類有重疊，直接相加會把重疊的人／物件數兩次，所以要減一次：{{math:0}}
- 例：20 人會排球、25 人會籃球、15 人兩樣都會 → 全隊人數是 {{math:1}}
- 若題目問「至少一個」（例如至少一男一女、至少一部來自 A 區），可考慮反面計數：總數減去「兩樣都不是」的數目通常更快。

body.en:
- If groups A and B overlap, adding them counts the overlap twice, so subtract it once: {{math:0}}
- Example: 20 players can play volleyball, 25 can play basketball and 15 can play both → the team has {{math:1}}
- If the question says "at least one", count by complement: total minus the number belonging to neither group is usually quicker.

body.zh:
- 可以重複：每一步的選擇數目都一樣，所以用次方。4 位數字密碼（0–9，可重複）＝ {{math:0}}
- 不可以重複：用過的不可再用，下一位少一個選擇。4 位數字（不可重複，數字 0–9）＝ {{math:1}}
- 有位置受限制時先處理它：用 2、4、5、6、8、0 排 4 位數（不可重複），首位不可為 0，所以首位先揀 → {{math:2}}

body.en:
- With repetition: every position has the same number of choices, so use a power. A 4-digit code using 0–9 = {{math:0}}
- Without repetition: a digit already used cannot be used again, so the next position has one fewer choice. Four digits from 0–9 without repetition = {{math:1}}
- Handle the restricted position first: to form a 4-digit number from 2, 4, 5, 6, 8, 0 without repetition, the thousands digit cannot be 0, so choose it first: {{math:2}}
